<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head') %>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-50 text-gray-800">
  <%- include('partials/navbar') %>

  <main id="main-content" class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <section class="pt-8 pb-4">
      <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-primary-dark mb-1">Tanya AI</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-600">Punya pertanyaan seputar stok, harga, atau jam operasional? Tanyakan di sini.</p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="chat-title" class="py-4 pb-12 flex flex-col gap-5">
      <h2 id="chat-title" class="sr-only">Ruang Percakapan</h2>

      <div id="chatWindow" aria-live="polite" class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-5 min-h-[220px] flex flex-col gap-3">
        <div class="max-w-[80%] bg-primary-light rounded-2xl rounded-bl-sm px-4 py-3 text-sm self-start">
          <p>Halo! Aku belum bisa membalas pertanyaan secara otomatis di sesi ini. Fitur balasan akan aktif di Sprint 2 ya 🙂</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <form id="chatForm" action="/tanya-ai" method="GET" class="flex flex-wrap items-end gap-4">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-1 flex-1 min-w-[250px]">
          <label for="chatInput" class="text-sm font-semibold">Tulis pertanyaanmu</label>
          <input
            type="text"
            id="chatInput"
            name="pertanyaan"
            placeholder="Contoh: Gula sekilo berapa?"
            autocomplete="off"
            class="border border-gray-300 rounded-md px-3 py-2 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary"
          />
        </div>
        <button type="submit" class="px-6 py-2.5 rounded-lg font-semibold bg-primary text-white hover:bg-primary-dark transition-colors">Kirim</button>
      </form>

      <aside aria-label="Contoh pertanyaan" class="bg-white border border-dashed border-gray-300 rounded-xl px-5 py-4">
        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-500 mb-2">Contoh pertanyaan yang bisa kamu tanyakan nanti:</h3>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-1 text-sm text-gray-500">
          <li>"Gula sekilo berapa?"</li>
          <li>"Masih ada beras 5kg?"</li>
          <li>"Bisa antar ga?"</li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </section>
  </main>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>

  <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
